([M-EBT Complex] \(Wine Red\) + EDTA -> [M-EDTA Chelate] \(Colorless\) + Free EBT \(Blue\).) Tj
T*
(Color change at endpoint: Sharp transition from WINE RED to SKY BLUE.) Tj
